      "title": {
        "en": "Praise for caring doctors amid front-desk friction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Veterinarians including Dr. Neuman, Dr. Gowda, and Dr. Pham receive warm praise from long-term clients for their clinical compassion and thorough patient care. However, several dissatisfied reviewers report cold reception interactions, dismissive attitudes toward elderly animals, and unhelpful emergency coordination."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive care for dogs, cats, and exotics"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the clinic's gentle handling across multiple species, including dogs, cats, rabbits, and rats. Reviewers highlight that veterinary staff show patience with timid animals and perform routine procedures such as nail trims quickly to keep pets comfortable and relaxed."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frustrations regarding billing and surcharges"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Billing practices draw recurrent criticism from multiple reviewers. Clients report frustrations with mandatory comprehensive doctor exam fees for basic shots, an unexpected three percent credit card surcharge, and sales pitches for monthly wellness memberships, feeling that costs have grown excessive."
      }
    }
  ],
